  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfLevelOfFairValueHierarchyWithinWhichFairValueMeasurementIsCategorised contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_LevelsOfFairValueHierarchyAxis_ifrs-full_Level1OfFairValueHierarchyMember" xml:lang="ko">동일한 자산이나 부채에 대한 활성시장의 (조정되지 않은) 공시가격</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfLevelOfFairValueHierarchyWithinWhichFairValueMeasurementIsCategorised>
